ZCL_COMMAND_READY_COMMAND(
    "ops.mesh.device.host.client", "ops.mesh.device.host", "",
    "Run one raw foreground selected-route HOST client",
    "Linux and macOS foreground raw CLI only, before node/config startup. Exactly one --input JSON or --input-file=<absolute owner file>; stdout contains only authenticated application bytes, stderr public tokens. Explicit profile (location relied on unverified), peer/root/directional target_port, route_id/literal IPv4/route_port, confirm=true and finite connect/handshake/session/idle milliseconds required (hard maxima session 28800000 = 8 h, idle 1800000 = 30 min; grant expiry and revocation still end a session sooner). No DNS, shell, automatic backup, RPC/JSON stream fallback or guest authority. Stdin/stdout exclusive pipe/connected-stream descriptions independent of stderr; original status flags restored. Fresh session after restart/restore; restore entropy qualification is separate.",
    ZCL_COMMAND_RESULT_BUDGET, "mesh,device,host,psk,raw,foreground",
